OL,3,GNEWSABoy sentenced for stabbing girl
OL,4,Awho would not date him
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "obsessed" boy who stabbed a girl
OL,7,Fmultiple times with a 6in knife after
OL,8,Fshe refused to date him has been handed
OL,9,Fa three-year restraining order.
OL,11,FThe boy, 14, briefly dated the girl,
OL,12,F14, before she ended the relationship.
OL,13,FHe then carried out a "horrifying"
OL,14,Fattack in a shop in Cirencester,
OL,15,FGloucestershire, in March.
OL,17,FThe boy, from Wiltshire, admitted
OL,18,Fwounding with intent, inflicting
OL,19,Fgrievous bodily harm and possession of
OL,20,Fa bladed article in a public place. He
OL,21,Fwas also handed a one-year referral
OL,22,Forder at Gloucester Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
