OL,3,GNEWSABoy sentenced for stabbing girl
OL,4,Awho would not date him
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement read out in court, the
OL,7,Fgirl said: "I've been having nightmares
OL,8,Fsince. I relive the incident, but in
OL,9,Fthese dreams it happens in different
OL,10,Fplaces."
